strongest woman player ever, beats Kasparov for the first time, in the Berlin endgame he
usually defended well.} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 Nf6 4. O-O Nxe4 5. d4 Nd6 6. Bxc6 dxc6
